    "intro_narrative": "The world ended decades ago in a storm of nuclear fire and engineered plagues. You are a Scrapper, exploring the irradiated remains of Sector 7. Deep beneath the cracked earth, you've discovered an intact pre-war military bunker. Rumor has it that this facility houses a pristine survival cache that could sustain your settlement for years. However, the bunker's automated defense systems and heavily encrypted data networks are still active. You must navigate a labyrinth of ancient terminals, cryptographic modules, and rusted containers. Track the data flows, bypass the security protocols, and unlock the final secure cache before your radiation suit's filters completely fail.",
    "narrative_style": "post_apocalyptic"
